   "lines": [
    "Have had 2 examinations",
    "this week & so have",
    "been studying hard.",
    "My horse has arrived;",
    "I determined to keep",
    "him in Cambridge",
    "this Spring. I keep",
    "him at Pikes stable.",
    "Went over to",
    "Chestnut Hill in the",
    "afternoon, where I",
    "intend to pass Saturday",
    "& Sunday. We dined",
    "at the Lees."
